    "detailed_description": "<h1>Save Humanity!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/3291f1b7a899ed4b49a02f6371805891.avif?t=1746381582\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soldiers vs Zombies is a tower defense game where zombies have overrun the world, and humanity\u2019s last hope lies in elite soldiers. Armed from laser rifles to death machine guns, you\u2019ll deploy troops and use special skills to stop waves of mutated zombies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/bf77936c51a2437ece740c2a0943aaf9.webp?t=1746381582\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/dc67e32627b4cf4de9baff59375d2d15.poster.avif?t=1746381582\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/dc67e32627b4cf4de9baff59375d2d15.webm?t=1746381582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/dc67e32627b4cf4de9baff59375d2d15.mp4?t=1746381582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Soldiers vs Zombies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldiers vs Zombies is a fast-paced tower defense game set in a world overrun by zombies. Command elite soldiers armed with powerful weapons like laser rifles and the death machine gun to stop waves of mutated zombies. Each soldier has unique abilities, and you can upgrade their stats to face increasingly tough challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/94daaa20409b1fb23c3322fa6ee6aca9.webp?t=1746381582\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/e833857fd71eeb4a27c9b51dacdacc45.poster.avif?t=1746381582\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/e833857fd71eeb4a27c9b51dacdacc45.webm?t=1746381582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/e833857fd71eeb4a27c9b51dacdacc45.mp4?t=1746381582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 40 levels, diverse zombie types, and a variety of skills at your disposal, you'll need to think strategically to survive. Use your soldiers' abilities and powerful weapons to prevent humanity\u2019s extinction in this action-packed and tactical defense experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soldiers vs Zombies is a tower defense game where zombies have overrun the world, and humanity\u2019s last hope lies in elite soldiers. Armed from laser rifles to death machine guns, you\u2019ll deploy troops and use special skills to stop waves of mutated zombies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/bf77936c51a2437ece740c2a0943aaf9.webp?t=1746381582\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/dc67e32627b4cf4de9baff59375d2d15.poster.avif?t=1746381582\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/dc67e32627b4cf4de9baff59375d2d15.webm?t=1746381582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/dc67e32627b4cf4de9baff59375d2d15.mp4?t=1746381582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Soldiers vs Zombies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldiers vs Zombies is a fast-paced tower defense game set in a world overrun by zombies. Command elite soldiers armed with powerful weapons like laser rifles and the death machine gun to stop waves of mutated zombies. Each soldier has unique abilities, and you can upgrade their stats to face increasingly tough challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/94daaa20409b1fb23c3322fa6ee6aca9.webp?t=1746381582\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/e833857fd71eeb4a27c9b51dacdacc45.poster.avif?t=1746381582\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/e833857fd71eeb4a27c9b51dacdacc45.webm?t=1746381582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/e833857fd71eeb4a27c9b51dacdacc45.mp4?t=1746381582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 40 levels, diverse zombie types, and a variety of skills at your disposal, you'll need to think strategically to survive. Use your soldiers' abilities and powerful weapons to prevent humanity\u2019s extinction in this action-packed and tactical defense experience.</p>",
